"sec-gcv-title":"Understanding GCV — Honestly",
"sec-gcv-sub":"GCV ($314,159 per 1π) is a figure some community members hope Pi will reach. It has not been endorsed or confirmed by the Pi Core Team, and it may never happen.",
"gcv-highlight-title":"⚡ What You Need to Know About GCV",
"gcv-highlight-value":"GCV = $314,159 per 1π — a community aspiration",
"gcv-highlight-sub":"Not an official Pi Core Team value — a figure some community members hope the market will reach",
"gcv-explain-1":"The figure $314,159 per 1 Pi comes from a community calculation, not an official price set by Pi Core Team. Pi's real price will be determined by open trading once Pi is freely tradable.",
"gcv-explain-2":"Whether Pi ever reaches this figure depends on real-world trading once open exchange begins. Treat GCV as a long-term community hope, not a plan you can rely on financially.",
"gcv-power-tip":"Our view (Chigalex1's own opinion, not a Pi Network position): focus on what's in your control — getting KYC/KYB verified and learning the ecosystem. Nobody can guarantee what Pi will be worth.",
"gcv-p1-title":"Phase 1 — 10% Pi · 90% Fiat","gcv-p1-name":"Start Today. Zero Risk. Maximum Learning.",
"gcv-p1-desc":"Accept Pi for just 10% of every sale. 90% of your revenue remains in fiat.",
"gcv-p1-example":"🛒 Trader sells $100 worth of goods. Pi portion (10%): $10. Fiat (90%): $90. ✅ Stock replenishment fully covered.",
"gcv-p2-title":"Phase 2 — 25% Pi · 75% Fiat","gcv-p2-name":"Growing Confidence. Supplier Network Expanding.",
"gcv-p2-desc":"As more suppliers accept Pi, increase to 25%. Pay some suppliers in Pi — reducing fiat outflow.",
"gcv-p2-example":"🏪 Monthly stock $400. Pi portion (25%): $100 paid in Pi. Fiat (75%): $300. ✅ Business sustainable.",
"gcv-p3-title":"Phase 3 — 50% Pi · 50% Fiat","gcv-p3-name":"Half the Economy Runs on Pi.",
"gcv-p3-desc":"Pi income covers half your business costs. Rent, wages, suppliers split 50/50 Pi and fiat.",
"gcv-p3-example":"🏙️ Market in Harare, Lagos or Nairobi. Daily revenue $200 — $100 Pi, $100 fiat. ✅ Self-sustaining.",
"gcv-p4-title":"Phase 4 — 75% Pi · 25% Fiat","gcv-p4-name":"Pi is the Dominant Currency. Africa Leads.",
"gcv-p4-desc":"Cross-border African trade in Pi. No exchange fees, no bank delays, instant settlement.",
"gcv-p4-example":"🌐 Zimbabwe ↔ South Africa trade in Pi. No USD. No bank. No SWIFT fees. Instant.",
"gcv-p5-title":"Phase 5 — 100% Pi (If GCV Is Ever Reached)","gcv-p5-name":"A Possible Long-Term Outcome — Not a Promise",
"gcv-p5-desc":"If Pi's market price were ever to reach community GCV levels through real trading and demand, early adopters would benefit. This is a possible outcome, not a guaranteed one.",
