"alliance-box-title":"Umsunguli, Chigalex1",
"alliance-box-body":"IChigalex1 iyinkundla ezimeleyo yemfundo leyokungenisa ku-Pi Network, eyakhelwe ukusiza amaqhawe lamabhizimusi kuwo wonke amazwe angu-54 ase-Afrika ukuzwisisa njalo abambe iqhaza ngokuphepha kwi-enclosed ecosystem economy ye-Pi.",
"alliance-why-now":"Kungani ufunda khathesi?",
"alliance-why-now-body":"Ukuzwisisa indlela i-ecosystem ye-Pi esebenza ngayo — i-KYC, KYB, Map of Pi, PiDEX, lePi Launchpad — kukubeka endaweni eqinileyo yalokho okulandelayo, ngaphandle kokuthembela kuzithembiso zentengo ezingaqinisekiswanga.",
"lbl-gcv":"📈 Ulwazi Lwamahhala",
"sec-gcv-title":"Ukuzwisisa i-GCV — Ngokuqotho",
"sec-gcv-sub":"I-GCV ($314,159 ngo-1π) yinombolo abanye abomphakathi abathemba ukuthi i-Pi izayifinyelela. Kayikagunyazwa loba iqinisekiswe liQembu Oluyinhloko lePi, njalo kungenzeka kayisoze yenzakala.",
"gcv-highlight-title":"⚡ Okumele Ukwazi Nge-GCV",
"gcv-highlight-value":"GCV = $314,159 ngo-1π — isifiso somphakathi",
"gcv-highlight-sub":"Kayisiyo inani elisemthethweni leQembu Oluyinhloko lePi — yinombolo abanye abomphakathi abathemba ukuthi imakethe izayifinyelela",
"gcv-power-tip":"Umbono wethu (umbono weChigalex1 uqobo, hatshi isikhundla sePi Network): gxila kulokho okuphansi kwamandla akho — ukuba lesiqinisekiso se-KYC/KYB lokufunda i-ecosystem. Kakho ongaqinisekisa ukuthi i-Pi izakuba lenani elingakanani.",
"gcv-expert-title":"Umbono Womphakathi",
"gcv-expert-body":"U-Ms. Doris Yin labanye emphakathini wePi sebexoxe ngenani le-GCV le-$314,159 njengesifiso somphakathi sesikhathi eside. Lo ngumbono womuntu/womphakathi, hatshi isimemezelo loba isithembiso seQembu Oluyinhloko lePi.",
