  "sec-pidex-title":"PiDEX — Pi Decentralized Exchange",
  "sec-pidex-sub":"I-PiDEX yaqalwa ngo-March 2025. Hwebelana nge-Pi tokens ngokuphephile kwi-Pi ecosystem.",
