"sec-aboutpi-title":"Pi Network ke eng?",
"sec-aboutpi-body":"Pi Network ke projeke ya tjhelete ya dijithale ke baithuti ba Stanford, e lumellang batho ba tlwaelehileng ho raha Pi ka difono tsa bona — ha ho na hardware e bitswang.",
"pi-fact-pioneers":"Baetapele ba Sebetsang Lefatsheng","pi-fact-nations":"Dinaha tsa Afrika tse Apolweng","pi-fact-free":"Ho Kena & Ho Raha Letsatsi le Letsatsi","pi-fact-kyc":"Ho Hlokeha ho Bula Seruti","pi-fact-kyb":"Ho Dikgwebo tse Amohelang Pi","pi-fact-map":"ya Pi — Lenaneo la Dikgwebo",
