"pidex-big-c1-body":"O rekisetsa ka kotloloho, ha ho banka kapa mookameli.",
"pidex-big-c2-title":"Matangoana a Bokelo",
"pidex-big-c2-body":"Baetapele ba kenya Pi tangoaneng le arolelanoang.",
"pidex-big-c3-title":"AMM",
