"gcv-power-tip":"Pono ya rona (maikutlo a ga Chigalex1 ka boene, e seng maemo a Pi Network): lebelela se o ka se laolang — go nna le tiragatso ya KYC/KYB le go ithuta ecosystem. Ga go ope yo o ka netefatsang gore Pi e tla tlhwatlhwa bokae.",
