"faq-q1":"Pi Network ndi yaulere kulowa?","faq-a1":"Inde — yaulere kwambiri. Gwiritsani ntchito code ya referral chigalex1 pa minepi.com/chigalex1.",
"faq-q2":"Ndiyenera kukhalitsa app itsegulidwa kumba?","faq-a2":"Ayi. Gwirani batani la urutu kamodzi nthawi 24 za m'tsiku. Ndi izo zokha.",
"faq-q3":"Kodi GCV ndi chiyani, ndipo kodi ndi yovomerezeka?","faq-a3":"GCV (Global Consensus Value) ndi nambala yochokera kwa anthu ya $314,159 pa 1π. Si mtengo wovomerezeka wa Pi Network ndipo sinatsimikizidwebe ndi Gulu Lalikulu la Pi.",
