"lbl-faq":"Maswali","sec-faq-title":"Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara Kwa Mara",
"faq-q1":"Je, Pi Network ni bure kujiunga?","faq-a1":"Ndiyo — bure kabisa. Tumia nambari ya rufaa chigalex1 kwenye minepi.com/chigalex1.",
"faq-q2":"Je, ninahitaji kuweka programu wazi kuchimba?","faq-a2":"Hapana. Gonga kitufe cha umeme mara moja kila masaa 24. Hiyo tu.",
"faq-q3":"GCV ni nini, na je, ni rasmi?","faq-a3":"GCV (Global Consensus Value) ni idadi iliyotokana na jamii ya $314,159 kwa 1π. Si thamani rasmi ya Pi Network na haijathibitishwa na Pi Core Team.",
"faq-q4":"Ninapata nini kwa uanachama wa {MEMBERSHIP_PRICE}π?","faq-a4":"Ufikiaji wa maisha yote wa: AI Chatbot, Mafunzo ya KYC/KYB, Ramani ya Pi, Orodha ya Wafanyabiashara.",
