"pidex-big-gcv-title":"📈 PiDEX na GCV — Ukweli Halisi",
"pidex-big-gcv-p1":"Kila ubadilishaji unachangia ugunduzi wa bei.",
"pidex-big-gcv-p2":"Waanzilishi wanapozidi kutumia PiDEX, shughuli halisi za biashara zinajengeka — hii ni taarifa muhimu, lakini haithibitishi wala kuhakikisha bei yoyote maalum, ikiwemo GCV.",
