"pidex-big-gcv-p1":"Kowanne musaya na taimakawa gano farashi.",
"pidex-big-gcv-p2":"Yayin da karin majagaba ke amfani da PiDEX, ainihin aikin ciniki yana haɓaka — wannan bayanai ne masu amfani, amma ba ya tabbatar ko bayar da tabbacin wani farashi na musamman, ciki har da GCV.",
"pidex-big-gcv-tip":"Ra'ayinmu: amfani na gaskiya na PiDEX yana da kyau ga tsarin Pi ba tare da la'akari da farashin da zai kai ba. Dauki duk wata lambar GCV a matsayin fatan, ba hasashe ba.",
