  "pilaunch-what-title":"Pi Launchpad dɛn ne?",
  "pilaunch-what-body":"Pi Launchpad yɛ Pi Network platform a ɛsɛ tokens hyɛ ase. Nnwuma foforɔ Pi ecosystem kɔ Pi boa kuo mu — na ɛhyɛ nkaafoɔ dawuro tokens foforɔ.",
  "pilaunch-stake-title":"Staking dɛn ne?",
  "pilaunch-stake-body":"Staking na wo kora wo Pi bi wɔ smart contract mu sɛ w'agyina nnwuma ho. Pi a wo akora no ma wo ho di ben na wanya token awieeɛ.",
  "pilaunch-commit-title":"Committing dɛn ne? (YE FIRI Staking)",
  "pilaunch-commit-body":"Committing yɛ biribi FOFORƆ. Wɔ Staking akyi, WO NKAA kamfo wo Pi kɔ nnwuma bi enti wanya awieeɛ. Staking nko ara NSO OTO — yɛ ƐKWAN ABIEN.",
  "pilaunch-slice-title":"SLICE — Token Mmienu a Ɛwɔ Testnet",
  "pilaunch-slice-body":"SLICE ne token mmienu wɔ Pi Launchpad Testnet. Wɔde yɛɛ nnwuma no hwɛ. Ntɔfoɔ a wɔKoree na wɔKamfoo Pi nyaa SLICE tokens.",
  "pilaunch-earn-title":"Sɛnea Wɔnya Launchpad Tokens",
  "pilaunch-earn-body":"Ɛkwan 1: Pi Browser → Pi Launchpad. Ɛkwan 2: Hunu token hyɛ ase a ɛreyɛ adwuma. Ɛkwan 3: KORA wo Pi. Ɛkwan 4: KAMFO wo Pi kɔ nnwuma. Ɛkwan 5: Twɛn atwa mu. Ɛkwan 6: Nya tokens wo ankasa.",
  "pilaunch-lock-title":"Ɛkwan Kɛse — Nkaafoɔ Nko Ara",
  "pilaunch-lock-sub":"Ɛkwan kɛse — kora, kamfo, yi nnwuma. Bu ne {MEMBERSHIP_PRICE}π.",
  "btn-unlock-pilaunch-txt":"🔓 Bu Pi Launchpad Ɛkwan — {MEMBERSHIP_PRICE}π",
  "pilaunch-warn-1":"⚠️ Staking nko ara AMMA WO tokens — WO NKAA kamfo.",
  "pilaunch-warn-2":"⚠️ Di Pi Launchpad nko ara wɔ Pi Browser a ɛyɛ sem mu.",
  "pilaunch-cta-title":"📚 Wo atenase kɔ Pi Launchpad mu?",
  "pilaunch-cta-body":"Pi Launchpad ɛkwan kɛse wɔ Chigalex1 mu — hwɛ nnwuma, kora, kamfo na nya awieeɛ.",
 
