  "pidex-cta-body":"Asegmi ameqqran n PiDEX deg Chigalex1 — asekkar n uẓebbaj, afran n tokens, asaɣar d tazlaft.",
  "lbl-pilaunch":"🚀 Iselmaden Kan",
