"gcv-power-tip":"Ngindu eto (ngindu ya Chigalex1 kaka, ka ya Pi Network ko): tala mambu malenda kutungwa kuaku — kukokesa KYC/KYB ye longoka ecosystem. Ka mutu mosi ko wunzayi una Pi wela baka ntalu nki.",
