"faq-q1":"Pi Network ya mbote ya kukota?","faq-a1":"Ee — ya mbote nyonso. Kozalisa code ya referral chigalex1 na minepi.com/chigalex1.",
"faq-q2":"Nasengeli kokumba app ifungami mpo na kukula?","faq-a2":"Te. Fina bouton ya mwinda mosi ntango 24 ya saa. Yango nde yonso.",
"faq-q3":"GCV i nki, ye i kieleka diau?","faq-a3":"GCV (Global Consensus Value) i nimero zunguluka kuna nkangu ya $314,159 muna 1π. Ka diambu dia Pi Network ko, ye Lusadusu Lunene lwa Pi lusi kondwa kudikikila diau.",
"faq-q4":"Nakozwa nki mpo na banani ya {MEMBERSHIP_PRICE}π?","faq-a4":"Nzila ya moyo wonso ya: AI Chatbot, Malonga ya KYC/KYB, Mapa ya Pi, Kalata ya Bayendi.",
